        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Fix StepFun login web ID",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- derive the StepFun login web ID from the anonymous token before building the Cookie header\n- add a regression assertion for the complete password-login Cookie header\n\n## Root cause\n\nThe login request interpolated `self.webID`, which is a function reference after `webID(forToken:)` was introduced. Swift emitted a warning and the resulting Cookie header could contain a function debug description instead of the required web ID.\n\n## Impact\n\nPassword-based StepFun fallback login now sends a valid `Oasis-Webid` value and the production build no longer emits the function-interpolation warning.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `swift test --filter StepFunTokenRefreshTests` — 8 tests passed\n- `swift build -c release` — passed without the StepFun warning\n- `make check` — passed",
